{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_registers_lwwregister", "label": "LWWRegister<T>", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/crdt-types/registers.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "State ist { value, timestamp, replicaId }; Merge waehlt den groesseren Timestamp, Ties werden ueber die Replika-ID deterministisch geloest. Der letzte Write gewinnt still - nebenlaeufige Writes werden dem Caller nicht offengelegt, einer davon ist einfach weg. Die einfachere Wahl fuer Feature Flags und zuletzt bekannte Konfig."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_registers_mvregister", "label": "MVRegister<T>", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/crdt-types/registers.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "State ist ein Set aus { value, dot }-Paaren, wobei dot ein Logical Clock ist. Vertraut der Uhr nicht, sondern tracked Kausalitaet direkt: nebenlaeufige Writes bleiben nebeneinander, sequenzielle ueberschreiben. Richtig, wo der Konflikt offengelegt werden muss; values() kann im Worst Case N Eintraege haben."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_registers_clock_drift_hazard", "label": "Uhren-Drift bei Last-Writer-Wins", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/crdt-types/registers.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "LWW per Date.now() ist nur so zuverlaessig wie die Uhren: eine Node-Uhr, die weit voraus laeuft, laesst ihren veralteten Wert fuer immer gewinnen. Entweder NTP im Sekundenbereich halten oder MVRegister nehmen, wenn Drift ein echtes Risiko ist."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_registers_lwwregister", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_registers_mvregister", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/crdt-types/registers.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_registers_clock_drift_hazard", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_registers_lwwregister", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/crdt-types/registers.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_registers_mvregister", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_sets_gset", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/crdt-types/registers.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_registers_lwwregister", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_maps_lwwmap", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/crdt-types/registers.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_registers_lwwregister", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_counters_gcounter", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/crdt-types/registers.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_registers_mvregister", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_designing_data_c